  "body": "This is an incredible opportunity to secure one of the larger available apartments on the entire Whangaparaoa Peninsula. Nestled inside the fabulous resort style gated community called Santa Rosa, this impressive home boasts 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, a large rumpus (could be a 5th bedroom) that blend effortlessly with the open plan living and dining areas. Complete with two dedicated carparks (one being undercover). It is the ultimate destination for families, or those seeking a premium 'lock-up-and-leave' sanctuary.\r\n\r\nFeatures of the property include:\r\n\r\n• Tennis Court: Perfect your game on the full-sized complex court just steps from your door.\r\n• Swimming Pool: Dive into the shared inground pool surrounded by sub-tropical lush landscaped garden.\r\n• Gated Security: Fully fenced grounds offer premium, hassle-free peace of mind.\r\n\r\nLife at Santa Rosa means everything you need is within arm's reach. You are just a brief stroll away from the vibrant Gulf Harbour Marina Village with an array of waterfront cafes, restaurants, and bars. Spend your weekends exploring the picturesque walking trails and 3 safe swimming beaches at Shakespear Regional Park.\r\n\r\nFor effortless travel, the nearby Gulf Harbour Ferry service offers a scenic, traffic-free commute directly into Auckland's CBD. Premium schooling options also anchor the area, including the local primary school and the top-tier Wentworth Private College.\r\n\r\nExperience true holiday-at-home living in a lovely friendly community.  Don't miss your chance to secure this rare coastal heavyweight!\r\n\r\nThe vendors are downsizing for their twilight years.",
